:: StoryTitle
Gob

:: Start
You start at the very end: in a hundred trillion years the last star will fade to darkness. You let your throbbing mind linger in the blissful void a moment longer.



In seven billion years the bloody rocks under your hands will turn to molten slag as the sun expands towards your once habitable planet.



In thirty millions years all the species of the world will join as one and sing the falsely enteral song of unity and love. The last battle will have been fought.



In twenty six years [[Joe McConnell]] will die peacefully in his sleep, surrounded by love ones, a respected member of the community.

:: Joe McConnell

# Joe McConnell

*Pb. Joe McConnell* (8 January 1632 - 24 December 1694) was a elvish real estate developer, adventurer & guild member from the kingdom of [[Ruritania]]. He is the third child and second son of [[Jefferson McConnell]], 27th Supreme Poobah (of [[Ruritania]]), and of his wife [[Alexandra McConnell]].

He is most known for his development and leadership of the city of [[Feyhaven]] as the Lord Poobah of [[Feymire]] (1652 to 1681). In 1677 he was the first Poobah to win the [["Outstanding County of the Year award"]] on the behalf of a formally [[green-zoned county]].

| Species: Elf
| Born: Joe McConnell ; 8 January 1632 ; [[Regapole, Rosetiam, Ruritania]]
