### Early Life

Joe was born in [[Regapole]], the capital of Ruritania, in the Yellow Palace the 8th of January 1632. From the ages of 6 to 18 he was tutored by members of the central guild hall in the arts of commerce, philosophy, history & swordsmanship. 

At the age of sixteen he joined the guild as an adventure, but stayed at the palace until the selection of [[Gregg Turkington]] as 27th Supreme Poobah in 1653 following the death of his father in the [[Battle of Quasmere]].

### Controversies 

In 1653 business man [[Mephisto Calliope]] accused Joe of abusing his authority as Lord Poobah of Feymire to take of advantage of the market and unfairly advantages his own properties and investments. In 1662 Mephisto Calliope recanted the accusations before being burned alive for devil worship and collusion with [[Belial, Hell-Lord of Lies]].

In 1677 after Joe was awarded the [["Outstanding County of the Year award"]]. Independent journalist [[Batabamat Fisto Nari]] wrote [[an article]] accusing Joe of having illegally removed the goblins living in the area in order to develop the settlement of [[Feyhaven]]. In 1678 he sued her for defamation. The case was resolved out of court.

